  "deletedAt": null,
  "deletedBy": null,
  "details": "Avatar culling should have a forward cone adjustment setting similar to earmuff mode's. There are times where I may be watching some sort of stage performance featuring a dancer or whatever else, I don't need to see everyone around me in a uniform radius. Because of how it works currently though I have to increase my radius and/or increase the limit enough to see the stage performer wherever they might go on stage. In doing this though I am having to load a bunch more avatars which impacts my performance. I think having more directional control over the avatar culling settings would alleviate this.",
